\fs14\
\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Sets whether the NSHost class caches instances as it creates them to avoid creating duplicate instances. If \i flag\i0  is YES, the NSHost class checks the cache before creating new instances. If \i flag\i0  is NO, it always creates new instances. Caching is turned on by default.\
\fs14\
